  "notes": "Mantine-style UI. Light grey canvas with white 8px-rounded cards that have 1px #dee2e6 borders and no shadows. The left rail is a solid slate blue (#6b7a99) with white line icons. The active rail item is a white rounded square with a subtle shadow, and the same slate tone shows the inactive icon colour. The year strip uses a soft grey pill for the selected year. Stat cards are dense label | count | duration (with a grey 'Avg.' line) rows, closed by a divider and a total row. The Expense card has a centred labelled divider, 'Totals per Currency'. The footer is fixed to the viewport bottom and overlaps content in the full-page capture. The OSM basemap brings the only saturated colour (sea blue, Leaflet's blue pins)."
